.TH PLUGPROBE 1 "2026" "plugprobe" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
plugprobe \- agent-driven CLI for hosting audio plugins
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B plugprobe
.I CMD --json ARGS.json
.br
.B plugprobe
.I CMD --json '{"key":...}'
.br
.B printf ... |
.B plugprobe
.I CMD --json -
.br
.B plugprobe --help
|
.B --version
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B scan
Find plugins (standard paths by default).
.TP
.B inspect
Automatable params + editor size.
.TP
.B render
Offline render (params/timeline/midi/video).
.TP
.B compare
A/B two audio files.
.TP
.B snapshot
UI node ids for act targeting.
.TP
.B act
Detached click/drag/type/slider-set probe.
.TP
.B session start|act|stop
Agent-paced takes (events replayed at stop).
.TP
.B meters
Loudness/spectrum of a session loop or file.
.TP
.B manual
Locate bundled plugin docs (agent reads them).
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.TP
.B PLUGPROBE_BIN
Path to the binary (contract tests, scripts).
.TP
.B PLUGPROBE_SCAN_CACHE
Directory for the plugin scan cache.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
0 on {"ok":true}; nonzero with {"ok":false,error:{code,message}} on stdout.
Codes: ARGS NOT_FOUND NO_OS_DRIVER CRASH AX_UNTRUSTED RENDER IO.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
README.md and SKILL.md in the project repo (agent workflow).
